+  "es": [
+   "Copying the Spanish gerund of posteriority: *He resigned in May, being replaced in June* instead of *and was replaced in June*."
+  ],
+  "de": [
+   "Placing the participle and its complements before the noun: *the in 2019 built plant* instead of *the plant built in 2019*."
